# PnP-trash curation: non-secret values only.
# Reference mapping only: supply each process only the subset documented in
# backend/README.md and the runbook. Backend Python does not automatically
# source this file. Never source the complete mapping directly into a worker
# or exporter; use the runbook's explicit env -i process launchers.
